cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Palletizer: an autonomous palletizing cell in ROS 2 Jazzy and Gazebo Harmonic"
abstract: >-
  A simulated palletizing cell: a UR10e with a suction gripper, a zone conveyor and a pallet
  station with a pallet-exchange handshake. Two overhead RGB-D cameras measure every carton,
  every pallet, the stack and every placement; a layer-pattern planner (with interlocking
  layers) or mixed-box planners choose the target; MoveIt 2 picks and places; a
  BehaviorTree runs the loop.
